- `/Users/myankelev/Code/random/cipher-box/packages/sdk/src/state/rotation-idb-store.ts` (new schema: `rotation-floor`, DB_VERSION 2)
- `/Users/myankelev/Code/random/cipher-box/packages/sdk/src/state/rotation-high-water.ts` (`CombinedFloorRecord`, `enforceResolved` write path)
- `/Users/myankelev/Code/random/cipher-box/apps/web/src/services/rotation-state.service.ts` (thin wiring over the SDK idb store)

